yes.wav, no.wav and seven.wav are three clips from the Speech Commands
dataset version 2 (Pete Warden, Google), licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Each is one second of
16 kHz mono 16-bit PCM of a single spoken word, used here to exercise the
decoder against the stock English model in tests.
